{
"answer": "Here is a classic recipe for baking delicious chocolate chip cookies.",
"steps": [
  "Preheat your oven to 375°F (190°C) and line a baking sheet with parchment paper.",
  "In a large mixing bowl, cream together 1 cup (2 sticks) of unsalted butter and 3/4 cup of white granulated sugar until light and fluffy.",
  "Add 1 cup of brown sugar, 2 large eggs, and 2 teaspoons of vanilla extract to the bowl and mix until well combined.",
  "Gradually add 2 3/4 cups of all-purpose flour, 1 teaspoon of baking soda, and 1 teaspoon of salt to the bowl and mix until a dough forms. Stir in 1 cup of semi-sweet chocolate chips."
